          "zh": "惰轮组高度统一 18 mm"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The idler is 8.5 mm, the spacer 9 mm, a shim 0.5 mm. Use shims and spacers to bring every idler stack to 18 mm.",
          "zh": "惰轮高 8.5 mm、轴套高 9 mm、垫片厚 0.5 mm。用垫片和轴套把每个惰轮组统一调到 18 mm。"
        },
