          "en": "Spacer must total 9 mm",
          "zh": "轴套总高应为 9 mm"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The spacer is 9 mm tall. If you cannot buy a 9 mm spacer, stack shorter spacers to a total of 9 mm.",
          "zh": "轴套高 9 mm。如果买不到 9 mm 轴套，用较短的轴套叠加到 9 mm。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:110mm; top:82mm; width:80mm;"
